 CODER, REVIEWER, RALPH, HAIKU\\nFAILURE: Git not initialized. Cannot commit changes\\n```\\n\\n### When to Return COMPLETE\\n- All PRDs have been processed (completed or failed status)\\n- No PRDs found in prds/ directory (but directory exists)\\n- All PRDs already completed or failed when starting\\n\\n### When to Return FAILURE\\n- prds/ directory doesn't exist\\n- Agent spawn fails (first iteration)\\n- Git commit fails (blocking operation)\\n- File operation fails (blocking operation)\\n\\nReturn format uses standard SUCCESS/FAILURE prefixes: \\\"SUCCESS: message\\\" or \\\"FAILURE: message\\\"\",\"new_string\":\"## Return Content\\n\\nOn SUCCESS: provide a summary including:\\n- Number of PRDs completed\\n- Number of PRDs failed\\n- Git commit hashes (if any)\\n\\nOn FAILURE: provide specific details for:\\n- No PRDs directory found\\n- Invalid agent name\\n- Agent initialization failures\\n- Git operation failures\\n- File operation failures\"}","name":"editfile"},"id":"call_-7965175452667606224","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"role":"tool","content":"{\"success\":true,\"file_path\":\"/Users/davekinkead/Projects/son-of-ralph/agents/RALPH.md\"}","tool_call_id":"call_-7965175452667606224"}],"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"bash","description":"Execute bash commands in the project directory","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"command":{"type":"string","description":"The bash command to execute"}},"required":[]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"readfile","description":"Read the contents of a file","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"The absolute path to the file to read"}},"required":[]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"writefile","description":"Write content to a file (overwrites existing content)","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"The absolute path to the file to write"},"content":{"type":"string","description":"The