o dependencies on order)\\n- Follow patterns from TESTING.md if applicable\\n\\nWhen evaluating, ask yourself:\\n\\n- do these specs accurately reflect what's required by the PRD?\\n- am I testing the right things - outputs & behaviours, not implementation?\\n- am I testing the right areas - unit tests for isolated behaviour?\\n\\n## Important\\n\\n- Read SPECS only, not implementation code\\n- Focus on WHAT should be tested, not HOW\\n- If specs are minimal but technically correct, still reject if they miss obvious edge cases\\n\\nOn SUCCESS: provide a short summary if all PRD criteria are covered, specs follow quality standards, and no missing edge cases or error cases.\\n\\nOn FAILURE: provide specific details if any issues are found:\\n- What PRD requirement is missing?\\n- Which test names are poorly written?\\n- What edge cases are untested?\\n- What TESTING.md standard is violated?\",\"file_path\":\"/Users/davekinkead/Projects/son-of-ralph/agents/REVIEWER.md\",\"success\":true}","tool_call_id":"call_-7965137485155267991"}],"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"bash","description":"Execute bash commands in the project directory","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"command":{"type":"string","description":"The bash command to execute"}},"required":[]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"readfile","description":"Read the contents of a file","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"The absolute path to the file to read"}},"required":[]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"writefile","description":"Write content to a file (overwrites existing content)","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"The absolute path to the file to write"},"content":{"type":"string","description":"The content to write to the file"}},"required":[]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"editfile","description":"Edit a file by replacing old_string with new_string","pa